WEBVTT

00:06.089 --> 00:08.341
THIS EPISODE CONTAINS
GRAPHIC DEPICTIONS OF SCHOOL VIOLENCE

00:08.425 --> 00:09.926
WHICH SOME VIEWERS MAY FIND DISTURBING.

01:25.126 --> 01:25.960
Wait here.

01:31.883 --> 01:33.259
Sir, you wanted to see me?

01:33.343 --> 01:35.136
I did. Take a seat over there.

01:35.804 --> 01:36.638
Yes, sir.

01:42.393 --> 01:43.228
Jeong-man.

01:47.774 --> 01:50.360
Hey, Jeong-man,
you fucking son of a bitch.

01:51.611 --> 01:52.779
Are you dealing guns?

01:53.905 --> 01:54.739
No.

01:55.323 --> 01:56.199
Are you sure?

01:56.282 --> 01:58.451
What are you going on about
all of a sudden?

01:58.952 --> 01:59.911
What guns?

02:01.955 --> 02:03.373
You're also confused, right?

02:03.456 --> 02:04.541
I was too.

02:05.333 --> 02:09.003
Some pig I know suddenly showed up
and asked if I was dealing guns.

02:09.087 --> 02:10.797
I was fucking speechless.

02:11.506 --> 02:14.467
A pig? He must be out of his mind.

02:14.551 --> 02:17.387
I thought the same,
but then he showed me this crap.

02:23.685 --> 02:25.311
Who is this?

02:25.812 --> 02:27.355
How should I know?

02:28.773 --> 02:31.901
Didn't you ask me the other day
if I knew any of your boys?

02:32.986 --> 02:36.239
I don't know a single one of them,
so I figured I'd ask you.

02:37.323 --> 02:38.950
He's not one of my boys.

02:40.285 --> 02:42.495
Be honest,
or you're gonna regret it later.

02:44.289 --> 02:46.833
Why would I ever lie to you, sir?

02:52.172 --> 02:53.673
So he's not one of your boys?

02:55.383 --> 02:56.301
No.

02:58.887 --> 02:59.721
Okay!

02:59.804 --> 03:02.807
I got fucking scared for no reason.

03:03.391 --> 03:05.226
That pig is a real headache.

03:05.810 --> 03:07.937
All right. You can go now.

03:29.834 --> 03:31.127
He's onto us.

03:31.211 --> 03:33.546
Find the guns as quickly as possible.

03:34.047 --> 03:35.965
Sir, what did that bastard say?

03:36.674 --> 03:38.426
He said he's not one of his.

03:38.509 --> 03:39.552
He said that?

03:40.720 --> 03:43.306
That bastard. What nerve to lie to you.

04:02.617 --> 04:03.952
- Hey!
- Oh man.

04:04.035 --> 04:05.370
Why's the floor so slippery?

04:05.453 --> 04:08.331
- Sorry to disturb your meal.
- What are you looking at, fuckers?

04:09.540 --> 04:10.667
Hey, hidden cam perv.

04:12.001 --> 04:13.836
Your life is about to go to shit.

04:15.922 --> 04:17.006
Just wait and see.

04:23.137 --> 04:24.681
That fucking asshole.

04:27.433 --> 04:30.061
Hey! Stop what you're doing!

04:31.729 --> 04:33.022
What's going on here?

04:33.106 --> 04:34.524
Well, sir,

04:34.607 --> 04:36.359
the floor was so slippery.

04:36.442 --> 04:39.362
You should be more careful.
Look at this mess.

04:39.445 --> 04:40.446
Are you okay?

04:41.698 --> 04:43.533
Do I look okay to you?

04:43.616 --> 04:46.119
What's with that attitude?
I was just worried, so--

04:47.578 --> 04:48.788
Why, that little…

04:49.289 --> 04:50.206
Hey, you!

04:51.666 --> 04:53.376
Look at that punk. Hey.

04:54.127 --> 04:54.961
Hey, Park Gyu-jin!

04:55.712 --> 04:58.673
What do you think you're doing?
Get back here!

04:58.756 --> 05:00.049
Kim Bae, wait for me!

05:00.133 --> 05:01.551
Here comes the failure.

05:19.861 --> 05:22.905
The more lists we find,
the more new addresses show up.

05:24.699 --> 05:25.533
Do.

05:26.034 --> 05:27.118
Look at this.

05:28.661 --> 05:30.538
I think this is the list's numbering.

05:31.039 --> 05:33.124
That means
there are as many guns as numbers.

05:34.125 --> 05:36.085
How many lists have we collected so far?

05:36.669 --> 05:37.587
Just over 20 pages.

05:38.921 --> 05:40.089
Oh man.

05:40.173 --> 05:41.674
That means they've distributed

05:41.758 --> 05:44.135
at least several hundred firearms
across the country.

05:58.358 --> 06:02.362
HAVE YOU HAD A CHANCE
TO LOOK FOR THAT ADDRESS LIST?

06:16.042 --> 06:17.418
OF COURSE

06:24.217 --> 06:26.010
TAKE CARE
LET ME KNOW WHEN YOU FIND IT

06:31.182 --> 06:33.851
OKAY! CALL ME
IF YOU NEED MOON BAEK'S HELP! I'M BORED

06:45.405 --> 06:49.367
That cop has been investigating you
for the past few days, boss.

06:49.992 --> 06:52.787
- Should we get rid of him quietly?
- Leave him alone.

06:53.913 --> 06:55.623
I need to confirm something.

06:56.124 --> 06:56.958
Yes, boss.

06:57.458 --> 06:59.752
I think you need to get going now.

07:03.214 --> 07:04.215
All right, then.

07:05.049 --> 07:07.635
Time to go meet some friends.

07:27.530 --> 07:28.656
Everything is ready.

07:55.933 --> 07:59.353
Hey. I heard you cursed out Seong-jun

07:59.854 --> 08:01.522
and threw a chair too.

08:01.606 --> 08:02.607
So what?

08:04.650 --> 08:05.776
Weren't you scared?

08:06.319 --> 08:08.488
He's going to be more cruel to you now.

08:09.155 --> 08:11.574
You put up with him,
so he keeps giving you shit.

08:12.366 --> 08:13.659
You're incredible.

08:17.205 --> 08:18.748
You pack quite a punch too.

08:20.875 --> 08:21.709
About that…

08:22.251 --> 08:24.462
- I'm sorry. I--
- It's fine.

08:25.588 --> 08:27.590
No one understands you better than I do.

08:28.633 --> 08:29.634
Thanks, Gyu-jin.

08:30.968 --> 08:32.345
What I'm saying is,

08:32.428 --> 08:34.388
if you're frustrated or annoyed,

08:34.472 --> 08:36.307
punch them or curse at them.

08:36.807 --> 08:38.768
Don't just sit there. Do something.

08:38.851 --> 08:40.394
Do you think I could do it?

08:41.187 --> 08:42.355
You son of a bitch!

08:47.985 --> 08:48.819
You bastard!

08:48.903 --> 08:50.071
You fucking bastard.

08:50.154 --> 08:51.739
This is so fucking interesting.

08:51.822 --> 08:53.324
Hey, get a good shot.

08:59.413 --> 09:01.791
- Out of my fucking way!
- Move, damn it!

09:04.585 --> 09:05.586
Unbelievable.

09:06.963 --> 09:07.964
Get over here!

09:08.631 --> 09:10.091
You motherfucker!

09:14.095 --> 09:15.346
You fucking bastards!

09:16.222 --> 09:18.849
SHOOTING CAFÉ

09:18.933 --> 09:20.977
- Is that okay?
- No way, seriously!

09:46.419 --> 09:48.713
SHOOTING RANGE SAFETY RULES
DO NOT FIRE AT PEOPLE

09:54.510 --> 09:55.803
A gun!

09:56.721 --> 09:57.555
Get away!

10:14.905 --> 10:16.115
Aren't those BBs?

10:16.616 --> 10:17.617
They're BBs.

10:18.159 --> 10:19.201
It looked like a real gun.

10:19.285 --> 10:20.494
Who is that bastard?

10:29.754 --> 10:30.963
Who did that, damn it?

11:01.369 --> 11:04.747
How dare you neighborhood punks
cause all this trouble?

11:06.499 --> 11:09.210
Hey, who the fuck are you? Huh?

11:11.337 --> 11:12.171
Me?

11:13.214 --> 11:14.465
I'm Moon Baek.

11:15.049 --> 11:15.966
That stings!

11:44.328 --> 11:46.747
- Fuck, he did that all by himself.
- Sick!

12:03.431 --> 12:04.682
Excuse me, just a second.

12:08.936 --> 12:09.770
Could you

12:11.105 --> 12:12.940
teach me how to shoot a gun?

12:14.400 --> 12:16.277
Hold your breath.

12:16.777 --> 12:18.821
When your body steadies,

12:19.447 --> 12:20.865
pull the trigger gently.

12:26.954 --> 12:27.788
Shoot.

12:33.210 --> 12:34.044
Hey.

12:34.628 --> 12:36.714
I suddenly feel confident for no reason.

13:08.037 --> 13:09.413
Here, take it.

13:10.998 --> 13:12.166
Wanna try shooting?

13:14.251 --> 13:15.127
Me?

13:16.045 --> 13:17.004
Yeah.

13:20.007 --> 13:21.008
I'm home.

13:21.509 --> 13:23.969
- Gyu-jin, you're back.
- Yeah, I'm just gonna rest.

13:34.980 --> 13:35.981
Gyu-jin.

13:36.899 --> 13:38.234
Have some fruit.

13:40.778 --> 13:42.154
Just leave it there.

13:48.577 --> 13:50.162
Are you sick or something?

13:52.957 --> 13:54.667
Let me see your face, please.

13:55.292 --> 13:57.586
Mom, I'm grown up now.
No need to coddle me.

13:58.420 --> 14:00.923
That's right. You're all grown up now.

14:01.841 --> 14:03.384
And without my help.

14:08.347 --> 14:10.182
You've given me everything I need.

14:11.433 --> 14:13.185
You're doing your best.

14:15.604 --> 14:17.022
Thanks for understanding.

14:19.525 --> 14:20.651
By the way, Mom…

14:21.735 --> 14:22.570
Yeah?

14:23.153 --> 14:25.447
When do people get the most upset?

14:25.531 --> 14:27.283
Well, for me,

14:27.783 --> 14:30.035
I get the most upset when you're sick…

14:31.704 --> 14:33.497
or going through a hard time.

14:34.331 --> 14:36.792
I guess all parents feel the same way.

14:36.876 --> 14:39.295
Nothing matters more to them
than their children.

14:40.963 --> 14:43.340
Gu Jeong-man started fetching
the guns from the list.

14:44.008 --> 14:45.134
And Mr. Kim's place?

14:45.759 --> 14:48.971
It seems no one has accessed
the storage room yet.

14:49.722 --> 14:52.224
They're so frustrating.

14:54.059 --> 14:55.102
This isn't it.

14:55.185 --> 14:56.103
INCORRECT PATTERN

14:56.729 --> 14:58.230
Not this either.

14:59.607 --> 15:01.025
Goddamn it!

15:01.525 --> 15:04.445
What good is the phone
without the damn password?

15:05.195 --> 15:06.030
Sorry, sir.

15:06.113 --> 15:07.698
Sorry won't cut it, bastards!

15:07.781 --> 15:09.408
Fucking bastards.

15:11.994 --> 15:14.663
NO CALLER ID

15:17.541 --> 15:18.584
Hello?

15:22.880 --> 15:23.839
Who the hell is this?

15:23.923 --> 15:26.258
Why the hell
are you speaking English to me?

15:26.759 --> 15:28.135
What's the matter, sir?

15:42.441 --> 15:45.569
"Red sticker"?
Hey, find the box with a red sticker.

15:45.653 --> 15:48.572
But every box in here
has a red sticker, sir.

15:56.205 --> 16:00.834
Mr. Kim, that bastard.
What the hell is he hiding in here?

16:01.335 --> 16:02.878
What the fuck is this?

16:04.922 --> 16:05.923
Why is this here?

16:06.590 --> 16:08.842
You found them? The guns?

16:12.972 --> 16:15.265
If you're curious, try shooting yourself.

16:18.894 --> 16:22.564
All the recent shootings in the news
involved guns from that room.

16:24.233 --> 16:25.484
You know,

16:25.567 --> 16:29.363
since you took out Mr. Kim,
the guns are just piling up in there,

16:30.072 --> 16:31.281
and Mr. Kim is gone.

16:32.199 --> 16:34.535
This puts me in a weird spot, you know?

16:36.453 --> 16:37.830
Weirdly enough,

16:39.289 --> 16:42.084
someone is really determined
to find those guns.

16:45.170 --> 16:46.130
Gu Jeong-man?

16:46.213 --> 16:47.214
Gu Jeong-man?

16:47.840 --> 16:49.174
How do you know him?

16:50.884 --> 16:53.804
I don't know what Gu Jeong-man is up to,

16:53.887 --> 16:56.432
but you should really think things over.

16:57.891 --> 16:59.393
Like what you should do

17:00.060 --> 17:01.395
with all those guns.

17:03.981 --> 17:05.107
Hello?

17:06.900 --> 17:07.901
Fucking bastard.

17:29.882 --> 17:31.925
Hey, this is a bet.

17:37.848 --> 17:39.516
Yes, we have secured enough.

17:42.102 --> 17:43.353
We'll get right to it.

17:52.279 --> 17:53.989
Excuse me, gentlemen!

17:55.074 --> 17:56.075
Hello.

17:56.158 --> 17:59.703
Can I just ask you
to remember this one thing, please?

17:59.787 --> 18:02.873
Take a photo
after delivering the package, okay?

18:03.373 --> 18:07.169
You need to take a picture
and send it to us

18:07.252 --> 18:09.296
so we can process the payment.

18:09.379 --> 18:10.714
- Is that clear?
- Yes!

18:13.842 --> 18:15.427
Here, this way. Come on.

18:18.597 --> 18:19.932
- No rush.
- Remember the photo.

18:20.432 --> 18:23.018
Yes, good. Here, take these.

18:26.105 --> 18:27.481
The packages are ready.

18:28.649 --> 18:29.483
Are they?

18:30.734 --> 18:34.238
It's great how many delivery options
are available in Korea.

18:42.037 --> 18:43.455
Come home early tonight.

18:43.956 --> 18:45.457
I'll get the meat you like.

18:57.970 --> 18:59.972
I thought you were too old for this.

19:00.055 --> 19:02.474
Now you're sweet
since I said I'd buy you meat?

19:03.976 --> 19:06.019
- See you later.
- All right.

19:14.486 --> 19:15.612
Reporting an update.

19:15.696 --> 19:18.657
The student is now on his way
to school with a gun.

19:20.534 --> 19:22.536
How old were you when you were adopted?

19:24.163 --> 19:25.080
Nine years old.

19:25.664 --> 19:27.166
Did you find your mom and dad?

19:28.667 --> 19:29.501
Yes.

19:30.377 --> 19:31.420
How were they?

19:31.503 --> 19:33.422
I only watched them from afar.

19:37.217 --> 19:38.093
How come?

19:38.177 --> 19:41.555
I thought I'd be miserable
if they didn't remember me.

19:45.350 --> 19:46.351
I see.

19:49.938 --> 19:50.939
Then…

19:52.774 --> 19:54.484
we should make them remember.

20:03.577 --> 20:05.829
Line 3, 30% of delivery photos received.

20:05.913 --> 20:07.456
Line 2, 30% of photos received.

20:07.539 --> 20:09.833
Line 7, 50% of delivery photos received.

20:09.917 --> 20:11.501
Line 4, 70% of photos received.

20:11.585 --> 20:14.213
All couriers from Gyeongdong
on lines 5 and 7 confirmed.

20:14.796 --> 20:15.797
First photo received.

20:15.881 --> 20:17.507
30% of photos received from Dongin.

20:17.591 --> 20:19.426
60% of photos received from Gyeongseo.

20:19.509 --> 20:21.011
80% received from Gyeongseo.

20:21.887 --> 20:24.097
The gun packages are going out as planned.

20:24.181 --> 20:26.350
We will keep you posted
on further updates.

20:26.433 --> 20:27.434
Okay.

20:38.278 --> 20:41.114
Come on. At least try to look happy
to see me again.

20:43.116 --> 20:44.243
Is Kyeong-suk okay?

20:45.911 --> 20:47.412
Yeah. Thanks to you.

20:48.580 --> 20:49.456
The address list?

20:52.876 --> 20:53.710
Here.

20:56.004 --> 20:57.756
I don't usually trust people,

20:57.839 --> 21:00.592
but I think I can trust you, Officer Lee.

21:04.054 --> 21:06.765
But there's something bothering me.

21:08.141 --> 21:08.976
Over here.

21:10.519 --> 21:12.688
There's a high school student on the list.

21:15.857 --> 21:16.984
Shouldn't you check?

21:20.529 --> 21:22.614
Keep watch until Yeong-dong gets here.

21:22.698 --> 21:23.824
Yeah, okay.

21:30.205 --> 21:32.874
Did Yeong-dong die in a ditch
on his way to get bread?

21:33.709 --> 21:34.584
Hey.

21:35.752 --> 21:36.920
Let me bum a smoke.

21:37.004 --> 21:39.047
- Damn it.
- This bastard never has any smokes.

21:39.131 --> 21:41.842
Man, just buy your own, you cheapskate.

21:44.511 --> 21:45.345
What's wrong?

21:46.179 --> 21:47.264
Are you still pissed?

21:47.347 --> 21:48.682
Fuck-gyu, that fucker.

21:49.349 --> 21:52.060
The teacher's watching too closely.
I can't do a thing.

21:52.644 --> 21:55.689
Lie low for now.
One wrong move, and you're fucked.

21:56.273 --> 21:58.483
It's fucking embarrassing, you asshole.

21:58.984 --> 22:00.736
Seriously, who locked the doors?

22:00.819 --> 22:02.154
Goodbye, sir.

22:02.779 --> 22:05.115
- Sir! I need the restroom.
- How are you going to go?

22:05.198 --> 22:07.784
- Try pulling it.
- I said I need the restroom!

22:08.285 --> 22:09.536
What's the problem?

22:09.619 --> 22:10.871
Sir, he did it!

22:10.954 --> 22:11.955
What's this?

22:13.165 --> 22:14.416
- Locked from outside?
- What?

22:14.499 --> 22:16.418
- Did you do this, sir?
- You little punks.

22:17.169 --> 22:19.087
- Who did this?
- Break it down!

22:19.796 --> 22:20.797
Think this is funny?

22:29.848 --> 22:30.932
Hey, Park Gyu-jin.

22:32.434 --> 22:33.894
Class president. What's up?

22:33.977 --> 22:36.855
The homeroom teacher wants to see you.
Go to the faculty room.

22:43.362 --> 22:45.739
How should I fuck that bastard over?

22:45.822 --> 22:47.199
Hey.

22:48.909 --> 22:49.951
How about that?

22:50.869 --> 22:51.912
Shit, that's nasty.

22:51.995 --> 22:53.914
- What is that?
- Damn, that's gross.

22:53.997 --> 22:54.831
Hey.

22:55.582 --> 22:56.958
Go grab Fuck-gyu's bag.

22:58.752 --> 22:59.669
Yes, sir!

23:08.136 --> 23:08.970
Hey, Do.

23:09.471 --> 23:11.515
Why is it so hard to reach you?
Where are you?

23:11.598 --> 23:12.808
I'm looking for the guns.

23:12.891 --> 23:14.518
Head to Jeongil High now.

23:15.018 --> 23:17.896
One of their students is on the list.
He has a gun.

23:19.147 --> 23:20.148
Go there now!

23:24.569 --> 23:27.030
Turn around. We're going to Jeongil High.

23:30.659 --> 23:33.120
Hello, this is Officer Lee Do
from Domyeong Station.

23:33.703 --> 23:36.706
We met at a training seminar
on violence prevention.

23:36.790 --> 23:37.874
Yes, hello.

23:38.834 --> 23:40.043
How can I help you?

23:40.127 --> 23:42.170
I'm calling because there's a chance

23:42.254 --> 23:44.673
a Jeongil High student
is involved in my case.

23:44.756 --> 23:47.884
One of our students? What's his name?

23:47.968 --> 23:49.177
I don't know his name,

23:49.261 --> 23:50.887
but I have his number.

23:51.513 --> 23:53.890
Go ahead and give me the number.

23:53.974 --> 23:56.726
It's 010-337-8155.

23:56.810 --> 23:57.644
Did you call me?

23:58.228 --> 23:59.187
Wait a minute.

23:59.271 --> 24:00.147
I understand.

24:00.230 --> 24:02.649
I'll check and call you back
as soon as I can.

24:03.817 --> 24:05.444
Gyu-jin.

24:06.319 --> 24:09.948
I wanted to talk to you,
but something urgent came up.

24:10.031 --> 24:10.991
Come back later.

24:11.074 --> 24:12.033
Okay, ma'am.

24:12.117 --> 24:13.243
Sorry about that.

24:13.743 --> 24:15.912
How are things over there, kids?

24:15.996 --> 24:17.789
All the doors here are locked.

24:18.790 --> 24:21.001
As soon as I find out who did this…

24:21.084 --> 24:21.960
Sir!

24:22.043 --> 24:24.337
The western entrance
and snack bar are locked.

24:24.421 --> 24:27.841
Sir, could you ask the janitor
to bring us a bolt cutter now?

24:27.924 --> 24:29.801
You fucking bitch. Get over here.

24:30.635 --> 24:34.055
You fucking asshole.
Fuck you, motherfucker.

24:34.139 --> 24:35.432
You son of a bitch.

24:35.932 --> 24:37.809
Goddamn it.

24:37.893 --> 24:39.936
- You motherfucker!
- You son of a bitch!

24:41.980 --> 24:43.523
You fucking bastard.

24:44.858 --> 24:46.109
You motherfucker.

24:46.193 --> 24:47.360
You fucking dick.

24:48.195 --> 24:50.572
Hey, where were you?
Why are you so fucking late?

24:50.655 --> 24:51.490
You little shit!

24:51.573 --> 24:52.532
Fuck you!

24:53.033 --> 24:54.242
Fuck this.

24:55.535 --> 24:56.745
STUDENT RECORDS

25:01.875 --> 25:03.376
FIND: 8155

25:04.377 --> 25:05.337
NO RESULTS FOUND

25:14.679 --> 25:16.014
Hey, Fuck-gyu!

25:18.975 --> 25:21.311
What's up? Looking for this?

25:21.394 --> 25:23.813
Goddamn it, you little shit.

25:23.897 --> 25:26.191
Were you gonna shoot us with this?

25:26.274 --> 25:29.361
Man, I was wondering
why you've been acting so tough lately.

25:31.112 --> 25:32.656
Because of this damn toy?

25:32.739 --> 25:34.449
It looks real. Kind of scary.

25:34.533 --> 25:36.117
Scary? For fuck's sake.

25:36.618 --> 25:38.870
Hey, you scared of this?

25:38.954 --> 25:39.996
No, go ahead and shoot.

25:40.705 --> 25:42.415
You fucking losers scared of this?

25:42.499 --> 25:44.000
- Hey, you scared?
- Huh?

25:45.085 --> 25:46.378
It's just a BB gun.

25:46.461 --> 25:48.380
You stupid fucking idiot.

25:48.964 --> 25:51.508
Don't shoot.

25:51.591 --> 25:52.592
"Don't shoot."

25:57.138 --> 25:59.641
You're not going anywhere,
fucking asshole.

26:00.350 --> 26:04.271
The phone is turned off.
Your call will be directed to voicemail…

26:04.354 --> 26:05.939
The phone's still off.

26:06.898 --> 26:08.692
Kids turn in their phones before class.

26:09.317 --> 26:10.277
Can you go faster?

26:11.152 --> 26:12.195
Okay.

26:14.030 --> 26:14.864
Hey.

26:16.241 --> 26:18.285
Hey, you scared? Are you?

26:21.705 --> 26:24.708
This little bitch.
Hey, stand up straight right there.

26:26.501 --> 26:29.170
Don't shoot. You shouldn't shoot that gun.

26:30.338 --> 26:31.590
Hey, hold him tight.

26:33.925 --> 26:35.135
Don't shoot.

26:36.553 --> 26:37.387
Stay still.

26:38.263 --> 26:39.139
Don't shoot!

26:39.973 --> 26:41.182
CLASS 2-1 ADDRESS BOOK

26:41.266 --> 26:42.892
"8-1-5-5…"

26:42.976 --> 26:44.060
NO RESULTS FOUND

26:48.815 --> 26:49.858
Run for it!

26:54.112 --> 26:55.030
What was that?

26:56.364 --> 26:57.949
I didn't even pull the trigger.

27:05.665 --> 27:07.626
This bastard loaded it with steel pellets.

27:07.709 --> 27:08.793
Hey, are you crazy?

27:09.294 --> 27:11.087
Were you trying to fucking kill us?

27:12.047 --> 27:13.965
Yeah, I'm fucking crazy.

27:14.049 --> 27:15.300
You motherfucker.

27:15.383 --> 27:18.053
I'll shoot you with this,
you fucking asshole.

27:21.723 --> 27:22.641
I found it.

27:24.351 --> 27:25.226
"Seo Yeong-dong"?

27:25.310 --> 27:26.645
Run!

27:30.982 --> 27:33.276
I told you to stop.

27:45.705 --> 27:46.539
Going somewhere?

27:48.750 --> 27:50.001
Yeong-dong.

27:50.085 --> 27:52.629
I'm sorry, okay? I'm so sorry.

27:52.712 --> 27:54.673
I was totally in the wrong.

27:55.799 --> 27:56.758
Don't apologize.

27:58.510 --> 27:59.719
It's not like you.

27:59.803 --> 28:02.514
Please, no.

28:03.598 --> 28:04.974
Mom…

28:20.782 --> 28:22.492
Hey, he's got a gun!

28:26.204 --> 28:27.580
That crazy bastard.

28:27.664 --> 28:29.082
Get inside!

28:29.582 --> 28:31.126
- Hey!
- What is it?

28:32.001 --> 28:33.002
Out of my way!

28:34.087 --> 28:35.422
Get out of my way!

28:38.383 --> 28:39.551
Come on, move!

28:39.634 --> 28:40.927
Hey, don't push so hard!

28:41.010 --> 28:42.262
Get out, damn it.

28:42.345 --> 28:43.555
Get out, for fuck's sake!

28:44.472 --> 28:45.682
- Move!
- What's the holdup?

28:52.105 --> 28:53.106
Hey.

28:54.774 --> 28:55.984
There you are, Gyu-jin.

29:06.327 --> 29:07.579
It's okay.

29:09.456 --> 29:10.582
Nobody can get out.

29:20.091 --> 29:20.925
The doors…

29:22.218 --> 29:23.428
You locked them all?

29:24.804 --> 29:25.972
Yeah.

29:26.848 --> 29:28.141
Take this.

29:30.810 --> 29:31.811
Now, let's go…

29:38.318 --> 29:39.319
kill

29:40.361 --> 29:41.279
all of them.

29:58.505 --> 30:01.633
Move out of the way, motherfuckers!

30:01.716 --> 30:03.551
I said move, fucking asshole!

30:03.635 --> 30:05.595
- Open the door!
- Fucking hell!

30:05.678 --> 30:07.305
- What the fuck?
- Let us out!

30:12.060 --> 30:13.228
Help us!

30:25.782 --> 30:27.408
Move! I said move!

30:37.085 --> 30:39.170
- Over here!
- Help us!

30:40.129 --> 30:42.841
- Please open the door!
- Please help us!

30:42.924 --> 30:43.925
Over here!

30:51.850 --> 30:58.273
A FUTURE SOCIETY BUILT ON GOOD CHARACTER

31:03.945 --> 31:05.446
Please open the door!

31:05.530 --> 31:07.115
This one's locked too.

31:07.198 --> 31:08.408
Kids, step back!

31:08.491 --> 31:10.285
Hey, step back!

31:23.631 --> 31:25.008
Moon Baek, out of the way!

31:27.719 --> 31:29.262
Everybody out! Slowly.

31:29.345 --> 31:30.722
- Go!
- Hurry, get out!

31:30.805 --> 31:31.890
- Go!
- Hurry!

31:32.849 --> 31:33.850
Careful!

31:34.559 --> 31:36.060
Huh? Damn it.

31:50.617 --> 31:51.618
Run! Quickly!

32:01.085 --> 32:03.212
- This way. Quickly!
- Get in here!

32:03.713 --> 32:05.048
- In here. Hurry!
- Come on!

32:06.007 --> 32:07.467
Hurry. Close the door quickly!

32:07.550 --> 32:09.177
- Everybody in?
- Block the door!

32:09.260 --> 32:10.553
- Bring the desks!
- Hurry!

32:10.637 --> 32:11.721
Block the door!

32:11.804 --> 32:13.514
Don't close the door! Please!

32:22.607 --> 32:24.442
Fucking get in here already!

32:25.443 --> 32:26.736
Come on, hurry!

32:26.819 --> 32:27.779
Bring more!

32:29.906 --> 32:31.115
Bring more, damn it!

32:32.992 --> 32:34.077
Hurry! Push!

32:37.038 --> 32:38.039
Push!

32:46.255 --> 32:47.256
Come on, hurry!

32:49.509 --> 32:50.343
Hurry!

33:10.446 --> 33:12.448
Fucking hell. Seriously.

33:21.457 --> 33:22.500
Kang Seong-jun!

33:25.586 --> 33:27.255
I know you're here. Come out now.

33:33.720 --> 33:35.847
Kang Seong-jun!
Oh Sang-tae! Hwang Yu-seok!

33:36.889 --> 33:38.891
I told you to come out. I saw you in here!

33:44.355 --> 33:45.898
Crazy son of a bitch.

33:47.358 --> 33:50.653
If you come out,
I'll let everyone else live.

33:55.575 --> 33:56.951
So hurry up and come out.

33:59.454 --> 34:01.122
Shut up, you fuckers.

34:02.832 --> 34:04.083
Wait! Seo Yeong-dong!

34:07.628 --> 34:09.005
It's me, the head teacher.

34:09.839 --> 34:11.799
Can we talk for a moment?

34:12.633 --> 34:14.927
- Now? After everything?
- What?

34:16.554 --> 34:17.388
Sir.

34:19.390 --> 34:21.768
I came to see you several times.

34:23.603 --> 34:25.229
I said I was having a hard time.

34:26.647 --> 34:27.982
That I couldn't take it.

34:28.983 --> 34:30.276
I begged you for help.

34:30.359 --> 34:31.778
Right, Yeong-dong.

34:32.779 --> 34:33.780
I hear you.

34:34.655 --> 34:38.284
I'll handle everything for you,
so why don't you put it down?

34:39.327 --> 34:42.038
You don't seem like the Yeong-dong I know.

34:42.705 --> 34:44.457
Then what am I supposed to be like?

34:47.251 --> 34:50.922
The loser who gets his money stolen
and gets beaten

34:51.756 --> 34:53.049
every day?

34:53.132 --> 34:54.383
No, Yeong-dong.

34:54.967 --> 34:57.595
That's not what I meant. Calm down.

34:57.678 --> 34:58.846
Fuck you!

34:58.930 --> 35:01.933
You ruined my life,
so just shut the fuck up!

35:04.102 --> 35:05.019
Yeong-dong!

35:05.103 --> 35:06.896
Hwang Yu-seok is over here!

35:06.979 --> 35:07.980
Shut the fuck up!

35:08.064 --> 35:10.900
He said he'd let everyone live
if you came out, so just go!

35:10.983 --> 35:12.026
Shut the fuck up!

35:14.112 --> 35:15.154
Come out already!

35:16.697 --> 35:19.200
Hwang Yu-seok! Come out here now!

35:49.605 --> 35:50.439
Fucking hell.

36:03.411 --> 36:04.412
Hurry, get out.

36:05.246 --> 36:07.081
- Look after the kids.
- Okay.

36:07.582 --> 36:08.916
Go. Are you okay?

36:12.211 --> 36:13.713
Kang Seong-jun, come out!

36:40.698 --> 36:41.699
Kang Seong-jun.

37:07.725 --> 37:08.809
Is everyone okay?

37:09.435 --> 37:10.811
This is the police.

37:12.104 --> 37:13.231
Kids, are you okay?

37:13.940 --> 37:14.774
Anyone hurt?

37:14.857 --> 37:16.150
- No.
- No.

37:16.734 --> 37:18.027
Everyone seems okay.

37:19.028 --> 37:20.655
- That's a relief.
- Indeed.

42:16.367 --> 42:21.372
Subtitle translation by: Sung In Jang
